    }
  ],
  "explanation": "The pipeline begins with the Integration Strategy Builder drafting a comprehensive cross-border banking integration plan. The African Banking Expert then critiques it for regulatory, technological, and cultural feasibility. The Strategy Refiner incorporates this feedback, and the Integration Quality Gate iteratively validates the output, looping back to the Strategy Refiner up to three times if retry is triggered. Once the strategy passes, the Risk & Sequencing Analyst stress-tests it with quantitative scenarios and financial projections. The Final Strategy Refiner weaves these insights into a cohesive narrative, and the Executive Polisher delivers a formatted, board-ready final document."
}
